Upstream-Name: sde
Upstream-Contact: Hugo Moniz do Rego <hugomonizdorego@angelinojoana.com>
Source: https://github.com/hugomonizdorego/SDE-Desktop
Comment: Selviana Desktop Environment (SDE), developed by the Selviana DE
 Project. Selviana Desktop Environment, SDE and the SDE logo are trademarks
 of the Selviana DE Project; the copyright licenses below do not grant
 trademark rights (docs/LEGAL.md, docs/BRANDING.md). The licenses of every
 program and bundled component are also listed in
 /usr/share/sde/legal/components.json (data/legal/components.json).
 .
 The debion-desktop-base package built from this source is the integration
 of DebION GNU/Linux, a separate Debian-based distribution that ships SDE.
 .
 SDE is inspired by the Equinox Desktop Environment (EDE) and contains no
 EDE code.

